   w("progress","noun","/ˈprɑː.ɡres/","進步","improvement or development","make progress","make progress 進步（不可數）。"),
   w("vocabulary","noun","/voʊˈkæb.jə.ler.i/","字彙","all the words someone knows","Reading builds vocabulary.","grammar and vocabulary 文法和字彙。"),
